{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23300","headline":"岁假内命酒赠周判官萧协律 · 白居易","name":"岁假内命酒赠周判官萧协律","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"共知欲老流年急，且喜新正假日频。\n闻健此时相劝醉，偷闲何处共寻春？\n脚随周叟行犹疾，头比萧翁白未匀。\n岁酒先拈辞不得，被君推作少年人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23300.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23300","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}